@host = http://localhost:5000
@apiKey = sk_inserisci-qui-la-tua-chiave

GET {{host}}

### get serie
GET {{host}}/series/1


### post serie (redirect a login) con 302
POST {{host}}/series/new



### API get tutte le serie
GET {{host}}/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### API get serie
GET {{host}}/api/series/3
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### API post serie
POST {{host}}/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "x**2",
  "start": 1,
  "end": 10
}
